<% content_for :title, "About Us | World Affairs Council of Hilton Head" %>

<main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero__grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--sky">About the Council</p>
        <h1>A community of thoughtful global thinkers.</h1>
      </div>
      <p>We connect people across the Lowcountry with expertise, perspectives and civil conversation about the issues shaping our world.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-grid">
      <div class="prose prose--large">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>Our members include academics, diplomats, business executives, authors, government service personnel and people from all walks of life. Most live in Hilton Head and surrounding Beaufort County, South Carolina. The Council is open to everyone.</p>
        <blockquote>Our mission is to educate, engage and inspire our community regarding world affairs.</blockquote>
      </div>
      <aside class="fact-card">
        <span class="fact-card__number">1981</span>
        <strong>Founded on Hilton Head Island</strong>
        <p>What began as a small Foreign Affairs Seminar has grown into one of the community’s most active forums for international affairs.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Our commitments</p><h2>What guides our work</h2></div>
      <div class="value-grid">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>Trusted learning</h3><p>Programs connect our community with informed voices and diverse expertise on world events.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>Civil discourse</h3><p>We create space to respectfully express, hear and examine different points of view.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Open participation</h3><p>Members, guests, students and the public all have a place in the conversation.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="image-band"><%= image_tag "wachh/programs.jpg", alt: "A large Council audience gathered for a speaker program" %></section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container timeline">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Our history</p><h2>Four decades of global conversation.</h2></div>
      <ol>
        <li><time>1981</time><p>The Foreign Affairs Seminar begins with a small group at the Hilton Head Public Library.</p></li>
        <li><time>2005</time><p>The organization becomes the World Affairs Council of Hilton Head and affiliates with the World Affairs Councils of America.</p></li>
        <li><time>2012</time><p>Academic WorldQuest launches in partnership with the Beaufort County School District.</p></li>
        <li><time>Today</time><p>The Council offers speakers, discussion programs and student initiatives to the wider Lowcountry community.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
